      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 16,
        "content": [
          "Ngajinku ngungali ngawututu manana walikkujarra jarrwalut. Kuyangka, ngaji-nku jalak yuwani nyanuny ngalawuny. Nyamulu ngungu manku nyanuny karu, kulan tampang karru Ngulu karru wanyji ngajik-parni."
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "number": 17,
        "content": [
          "Ngajinku ngu jalak mani nyanuny ngalawuny nyawangkirri janjankirri. Kula jalak mani nyilarra wankawankatju ngulikarru wanyji yanuntja."
        ]
      }
    ],
